```java
class ResourceTest {
    private Connection conn;

    @BeforeEach
    void open() {
        conn = pool.acquire();          // if this throws...
        if (conn == null) throw new IllegalStateException("no connection");
    }

    @Test
    void usesConnection() {             // ...this body is SKIPPED
        assertNotNull(conn.query("SELECT 1"));
    }

    @AfterEach
    void close() {                      // ...but this STILL runs
        if (conn != null) conn.release();
    }
}
```
The test is reported as failed with the setup exception, yet cleanup in `@AfterEach` executes.

